Subject: [PATCH] fix(browser): preserve exact page ownership across external
 CDP resumes

Route console through the active command backend, omit unverified supervisor frame metadata, and keep actionable controls visible without breaking snapshot structure. Checkpoint exact native page identity per conversation and browser instance across fresh daemons; failed capture, closed targets and timeout recycling fail closed.

Verified with 711 browser tests (two independently proven baseline failures excluded), a real multi-process Chromium/backend harness, and a complete Jobo agent/server submission test. Independent review passed after targeted regressions. Local integration patch; not published upstream.
